      "content": "i've been looking through some old family records and these patterns are just... they're impossible to ignore anymore. it's not just coincidence. i feel like i don't actually belong here, like my whole lineage comes from somewhere else entirely. like we were meant for something way beyond earth. it's starting to feel like a responsibility i didn't ask for.",
